{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜港鐵工程問題(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-09-13-27-07YPM4nHEW.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：港鐵工程問題</p><p>正在施工的港鐵東涌西站工地被揭發石屎柱未灌到頂，可以如何修復？未來如何加強監管工程質素？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>立法會議員(新界西北)莊豪鋒</p><p>理工大學電機及電子工程系客座教授何永業</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.312500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T05:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:41.405499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:37.688983+00:00","content_hash":"ddfe5d0035abb38784031d2a0777c4b99b7416fe98c5681285a488531a2c685a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}